Vibhishana nearby shows flower-adorned Pushpaka and humbly asks what to do --- Rama deliberating affectionately with Lakshmana listening bids honour striving forest-dwellers with jewels wealth and ornaments --- Rama says with these joyful death-fearingless unretreating monkeys Lanka was afflicted and conquered and worthy honoured will be content grateful --- Rama says knowing Vibhishana generous gatherer compassionate and famed he informs --- Vibhishana duly honours all monkeys with jewel wealth shares --- Seeing honoured leaders Rama climbs peerless vimana taking bashful Sita on lap with mighty bowman brother Lakshmana --- Seated Rama tells mighty Sugriva Vibhishana and all best monkeys friend-task done permitted go as wished --- Rama tells righteous Sugriva comrade duty done go quickly to Kishkindha with army and Vibhishana dwell in Lanka given even gods cannot assault and he goes to father capital bidding farewell seeking leave --- Monkeys mighty with Vibhishana folded ask take all to Ayodhya to see anointed Rama salute Kausalya then soon return homes --- Righteous Rama says dearer than dear gained to get joy going city with all friends and bids Sugriva with monkeys and ministered Vibhishana quickly climb --- Sugriva with army ministers and Vibhishana quickly climb divine Pushpaka and permitted by Raghava Kubera seat rises to sky --- By swan-yoked shining vimana joyful assured Rama shone like Kubera